ind":"announcement","title":"Multiplayer FIXED","summary":"Hey! We were getting multiple reports of issues with hosting on multiplayer. Thanks to some very helpful friends and a patch, we can now confirm that multiplayer now works!!I want to give a big apology to everyone that wanted to play with their friends and couldn't the last couple days. Solo and multiplayer are both equally as important to us for our community.Please let us know about any issues you may come across, and I hope you all enjoy playing with your friends! :)-Justin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T19:25:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030103","verified_at":"2026-10-21T23:27:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4592710-1847286114027448","game_id":"steam-4592710","kind":"update","title":"Next Fest Patch!","summary":"Howdy all!Thank you so much for all the interest in our little seal game, and thank you for all the feedback!We wanted to put up a patch to help out with some known issues and to make it easier to give feedback. Check out the notes below:Squashed Bugs and tuningFixed an issue where red healing particles were showing up from the sunspot when they shouldn'tFixed an issue where joining via Steam Overlay on the main menu wouldn't load the lobby levelSolved an issue where hosting had some odd statesM","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T03:48:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027448","verified_at":"2026-10-21T06:21:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4592710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:53Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:53Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4592710":"2026-10